OL,3,GNEWSAScottish councils want a rethink
OL,4,Aon reform plans - is there a way
OL,5,Aforward?
OL,6,
OL,7,FCouncil leaders have called for the
OL,8,FScottish government to "rethink" its
OL,9,Fproposals for local government reforms.
OL,11,FMinisters have proposed replacing
OL,12,Fexisting councils with six to 10 large
OL,13,Fregional authorities and more than a
OL,14,Fhundred smaller local bodies.
OL,16,FFollowing a meeting of the 32 council
OL,17,Fleaders, umbrella body Cosla said a
OL,18,Fchange of structure alone is not the
OL,19,Fanswer.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
